						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I would have to say Corwil. He was the one who got me into Dragonflyers back in the day and thus I met the people who would shape my EQ life for a long time, good and bad.<br /><br />Kestra and Crowley who helped me with a lot of the skill building that made me into the mage I am today be it good or bad.<br /><br />Faned/Yili and Galis who helped me build on what I had started with Kestra and Crowley.<br /><br />Callador with whom I have spent a lot of EQ time.<br /><br />There are more but I think those are the ones who helped me shape my EQ life the most.</td>
