						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Has anyone else been having problems logging into EQ after the latest patch ? I have two computers and EQ works fine on my main. On my secondary though I get an eqgame.exe fatal error right after the server select screen. Seems it is somehow linked to the eqgfx_dx8.dll file as well. Tried to copy the files from the main computer to the secondary but it didn&#039;t work. So right now I am at a loss. I have a Voodoo 3 card on the old comp but it &#039;shouldn&#039;t&#039; by why it doesn&#039;t work since it worked before (new one has a GeForce 2 card)<br /><br />Soeee, if anyone has any idea what might be wrong I would love some input <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Ps, have tried both DX8.1 and DX9 but still no go.</td>
