							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I like LDoN best because of the fact that it lets semi casual players get some nice items. And you don&#039;t have to raid for hours and hours to get them. &nbsp;You can do one adventure once in a while and sooner or later you will get the item you have set your eyes on.<br />And I still think it is more fun to crawl through a dungeon that sit in the same spot for god knows how long and have someone train you or steal your mob (BoT comes to mind strangely enough :P)</td>
